            "review_title": "Review at Quan Com Chay Buu Niem",
            "review_text": "Andrew Gartner\n6 contributions\n0\nQuality vegetarian food\nSep 2019\nAfter 4 months in Vietnam, this is easily my favourite restaurant. Great selection of interesting and nicely prepared Vietnamese and Thai vegetarian and vegan dishes. Fast, friendly service and pleasant atmosphere. The price is very reasonable and the quality is excellent. So glad I found this place!\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten September 11, 2019\nCơm Chay Bửu Niệm\nThanks and see you again❤️\nWritten October 26, 2019\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
